  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**What this dashboard answers:** is the Mem0 server healthy right now, and is it being used?\n\n* Source: Prometheus counters and histograms scraped from `mem0-server` every 15s. These are **aggregates only**: they never show query text, filters or memory IDs.\n* **HTTP Request Rate / Error Rate (5xx) / Latency p50-p95-p99:** per `method` and `path`. A rising 5xx line or a p99 far above p50 on `/search` or `/retrieve` means a slow or failing backend stage. Next: open **Mem0 — Retrieval Pipeline** to see which stage.\n* **Memory Operation Rate:** calls per operation (`add`, `search`, `retrieve`, `delete`...). A flat line means nothing is calling Mem0 (client disabled, wrong URL).\n* **Memory Reuse Rate:** share of search/retrieve calls that returned at least one result. A drop means more calls find nothing. Next: open **Mem0 — Query Misses** to see exactly which queries, with their filters and labels.\n* **No data** on a panel usually means no traffic in the selected time range, not a broken panel."
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "HTTP Traffic",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "HTTP Request Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "last"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(http_requests_total[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{path}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Requests per second by method, path and status code. Flat zero = nobody is calling the server.\n\n**Read:** requests per second by method, path and status.\n\n**Look for:** flat zero (nobody calls the server) or unexpected paths.\n\n**Example:** constant `/metrics` only = Prometheus scraping, no real traffic."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "HTTP Error Rate (5xx)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "last"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(http_requests_total{status_code=~\"5[0-9][0-9]\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{path}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Server errors per second. Any sustained line is a failing backend; check the server logs and Mem0 — Retrieval Pipeline.\n\n**Read:** 5xx responses per second.\n\n**Look for:** any sustained line.\n\n**Example:** 5xx on `/search` while Postgres is down."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "HTTP Latency — p99",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "last"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le, method, path))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{path}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Slowest 1% of requests per path. Compare with p50: a big gap means occasional slow stages, not a uniformly slow server.\n\n**Read:** the slowest 1% of requests per path.\n\n**Look for:** a big gap vs p50 = occasional slow stages.\n\n**Example:** `/retrieve` p99 8s but p50 0.7s = a slow rerank on some calls."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "HTTP Latency — p95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 19
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "last"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le, method, path))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{path}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "95th percentile latency per path.\n\n**Read:** 95th percentile latency per path.\n\n**Look for:** steady increase over time.\n\n**Example:** `/search` p95 climbing as the corpus grows."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "HTTP Latency — p50",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 19
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "last"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le, method, path))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{path}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Median latency per path: the typical request.\n\n**Read:** median latency: the typical request.\n\n**Look for:** step changes after deploys.\n\n**Example:** p50 jumps from 0.5s to 2s after enabling a new reranker."
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "id": 7,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Memory Operations",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Memory Operation Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "last"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(memory_operations_total[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Calls per second by operation, user_id and agent_id.\n\n**Read:** memory operations per second.\n\n**Look for:** which operation dominates.\n\n**Example:** only `search` = read-only usage; `add` = capture is on."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Memory Reuse Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "last"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(memory_retrieve_hits_total[$__rate_interval]) / rate(memory_retrieve_total[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "reuse rate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Share of search/retrieve calls that returned at least one result. It drops when more queries find nothing; see Mem0 — Query Misses for which ones.\n\n**Read:** share of search/retrieve calls returning at least one result.\n\n**Look for:** drops.\n\n**Example:** a drop to 0.4 = look at Query Misses to see the empty queries."
    }
  ]
}